1
00:00:00,103 --> 00:00:04,579
Behind the Curtain The amateur drama group prepared a comedy about a

2
00:00:04,592 --> 00:00:09,066
magician who could not perform a simple trick A clown would interrupt

3
00:00:09,079 --> 00:00:12,605
him a dancer would attempt a ballet step and a witty servant

4
00:00:12,618 --> 00:00:17,553
would reveal the illusion The final episode ended with a surprising gesture

5
00:00:17,566 --> 00:00:23,013
rather than a long speech Backstage someone repaired a scarlet cloak stitched

6
00:00:23,026 --> 00:00:25,842
a seam in a frock and attached a lace collar to a

7
00:00:25,855 --> 00:00:30,632
blouse A makeup artist adjusted a blond wig and added a wrinkle

8
00:00:30,645 --> 00:00:34,882
to make a young actor appear older The actress playing a goddess

9
00:00:34,895 --> 00:00:40,395
practised a graceful movement while the stage manager checked every cue Opening

10
00:00:40,408 --> 00:00:45,474
night brought nervous excitement The audience began to clap at the climax

11
00:00:45,684 --> 00:00:51,026
and the actors exchanged a grateful hug afterwards The performance seemed effortless

12
00:00:51,039 --> 00:00:56,539
only because innumerable small tasks had been completed with care Entertainment is

13
00:00:56,553 --> 00:00:59,882
often built on cooperation that the spectator never sees
